# 🤖 KnowGen AI

Enterprise Intelligent PDF Knowledge Assistant

## Features

- 📄 Upload Multiple PDFs
- 💬 Chat with PDF
- 🔍 Search in PDF
- 📝 AI Summary
- 📚 Study Notes
- 🧠 Flashcards
- ❓ Quiz Generation
- ⭐ Bookmark Answers
- 🔊 Text-to-Speech
- 🌙 Dark Theme

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Streamlit
- LangChain
- FAISS
- HuggingFace Embeddings
- Groq LLM
- PyMuPDF
